# DERIVED O1 DECK FIXTURE; NOT NEMO RUN EVIDENCE.
# No ORCA2_SAS_ICE run using this O1 deck was present on disk at authoring time.
# Values are the merged SHARED/namelist_ice_ref + O1 namelist_ice_cfg; labels
# are the corresponding unconditional WRITE formats in icestp.F90/iceitd.F90.
          number of ice  categories                           jpl       =            5
          number of ice  layers                               nlay_i    =           10
          number of snow layers                               nlay_s    =            5
          virtual ITD param for jpl=1 (T) or not (F)     ln_virtual_itd =  F
          Ice dynamics       (T) or not (F)                   ln_icedyn =  F
          Ice thermodynamics (T) or not (F)                   ln_icethd =  F
       Ice categories are defined by a function of rn_himean**(-0.05)    ln_cat_hfn =  T
          mean ice thickness in the domain                               rn_himean  =    2.0000000000000000
